        "created_at": "2015-01-27T18:56:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>same way you play chess againist yourself. you pick the move that you feel like will be the best againist the other team with what you have at your disposal to make that side win. This works better with the scenario mode than skirmish mode unless you want to test different strategies in your head.</p>",
