        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I playtested Tactics solo, because the goal was to find the way each hero played and what they could do, it worked fine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I understand the frustration with trying to play Tactics solo, because outside of playtesting the solo play kind of stinks. &nbsp;It is doable, but not a lot of fun.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would check out my Voss Scenario, and feel free to leave feedback if you do, I have played them a decent bit but they are balanced to my playtesting it, so it may not be balanced well beyond my own play and desired difficulty.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have been working on some more coop-style missions, but there is a real limit to the formats you can use and not have the game stink or be the same as the other scenario.</p>",
